{"kind":"action","text":"I submit one sequential A-then-B replay to the console: run A on the live module, copy its scores into an independent array labelled A, retain its Tensor wrapper, run B on that same module, copy B's immediate scores into an independent array labelled B, then read and copy the retained A wrapper's scores again. I request frame IDs on every read and put the saved references A=[2,0,-1] and B=[-1,2,0] beside the corresponding entries."}